WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.740
DAVID PAKMAN: We have a voicemail number,
(219) 2-DAVIDP [232-8437].

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:08.280
There's this really unhinged
Anti-Semite who calls in very very often

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:11.860
and we usually don't play his voicemails
for a variety of different reasons.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.880
Here is one that I do want to
play for you just to show you

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.640
the type of stuff that we're dealing with on a daily basis.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.420
VOICEMAIL: "Hey, you socialist.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:25.140
You know, you and AOC should go
back to Argentina where you belong.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:26.800
You're both a bunch of idiots.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.720
You're the bloody hemorrhoids on a hairy ass [CENSORED].

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.060
You socialist.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.680
All you want is votes for the Democrats.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.700
Why don't you go back to Argentina?

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.560
Maybe you can wipe your ass there.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.240
With - wait, both your asses; You and AOC."

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.700
DAVID: Mmm, no

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.240
I'm not a socialist.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:51.220
I don't know why this keeps coming up,
but I'm just I'm not a socialist

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:55.040
and the idea that - I mean listen,

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:58.600
Alexandria Castro Cortez is Puerto Rican by heritage.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.740
I don't and she's American of course, as all Puerto Ricans are.

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:05.080
I don't know why she would go to Argentina at all necessarily

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.040
and certainly I don't know about going back to Argentina,

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:14.040
but this is the type of stuff that day in and
day out we are fighting against and this is why:

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:17.280
you're not going to convince that person to change their vote, right?

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:20.420
Get 10 people to vote who would have stayed home because

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:25.020
it is a waste of time to try to
change the minds of people like that.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:28.480
Just don't do it; that can't be the strategy for the left in 2020.

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.280
We've got a great bonus show for you today.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:32.700
I'm out of time to tell you what is on it, but it's a good one.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.800
Become a patron, become a member.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:37.020
You'll get instant access and I will see you then.

